 gets scammed because they", "tokens": [50363, 1471, 281, 13830, 1048, 508, 12766, 284, 779, 2691, 11754, 290, 3011, 629, 10573, 780, 484, 50563], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11587222571511871, "compression_ratio": 1.58364312267658, "no_speech_prob": 0.24360038340091705}, {"id": 45, "seek": 19398, "start": 197.98, "end": 201.01999999999998, "text": " don't understand digital security.", "tokens": [50563, 836, 470, 1833, 4875, 2324, 13, 50715], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11587222571511871, "compression_ratio": 1.58364312267658, "no_speech_prob": 0.24360038340091705}, {"id": 46, "seek": 19398, "start": 201.01999999999998, "end": 204.94, "text": " It's not just about having a device, it's about having the skills to use it in a way", "tokens": [50715, 632, 338, 407, 655, 546, 1719, 257, 3335, 11, 340, 338, 546, 1719, 262, 4678, 284, 779, 340, 287, 257, 835, 50911], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11587222571511871, "compression_ratio": 1.58364312267658, "no_speech_prob": 0.24360038340091705}, {"id": 47, "seek": 19398, "start": 204.94, "end": 207.73999999999998, "text": " that improves life.", "tokens": [50911, 326, 19575, 1204, 13, 51051], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11587222571511871, "compression_ratio": 1.58364312267658, "no_speech_prob": 0.24360038340091705}, {"id": 48, "seek": 19398, "start": 207.73999999999998, "end": 213.26, "text": " And that brings us to the third, and perhaps the most dangerous, layer of the digital divide,", "tokens": [51051, 843, 326, 6774, 514, 284, 262, 2368, 11, 290, 3737, 262, 749, 4923, 11, 7679, 286, 262, 4875, 14083, 11, 51327], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11587222571511871, "compression_ratio": 1.58364312267658, "no_speech_prob": 0.24360038340091705}, {"id": 49, "seek": 19398, "start": 213.26, "end": 214.94, "text": " empowerment.", "tokens": [51327, 39309, 13, 51411], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11587222571511871, "compression_ratio": 1.58364312267658, "no_speech_prob": 0.24360038340091705}, {"id": 50, "seek": 19398, "start": 214.94, "end": 220.54, "text": " Even when people have access and skills, the real question is, who benefits from technology?", "tokens": [51411, 3412, 618, 661, 423, 1895, 290, 4678, 11, 262, 1103, 1808, 318, 11, 508, 4034, 422, 3037, 30, 51691], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11587222571511871, "compression_ratio": 1.58364312267658, "no_speech_prob": 0.24360038340091705}, {"id": 51, "seek": 22054, "start": 221.26, "end": 226.29999999999998, "text": " Big corporations, governments, and tech elites are leveraging digital advancements to expand", "tokens": [50399, 4403, 10225, 11, 6905, 11, 290, 7261, 21887, 389, 42389, 4875, 47220, 284, 4292, 50651], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1314789845393254, "compression_ratio": 1.575609756097561, "no_speech_prob": 0.16976264119148254}, {"id": 52, "seek": 22054, "start": 226.29999999999998, "end": 232.14, "text": " their power, while marginalized communities often find themselves on the losing end.", "tokens": [50651, 511, 1176, 11, 981, 31670, 5348, 1690, 1064, 2405, 319, 262, 6078, 886, 13, 50943], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1314789845393254, "compression_ratio": 1.575609756097561, "no_speech_prob": 0.16976264119148254}, {"id": 53, "seek": 22054, "start": 232.14, "end": 236.78, "text": " Job markets are shifting toward automation and digital skills.", "tokens": [50943, 15768, 5939, 389, 15852, 3812, 22771, 290, 4875, 4678, 13, 51175], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1314789845393254, "compression_ratio": 1.575609756097561, "no_speech_prob": 0.16976264119148254}, {"id": 54, "seek": 22054, "start": 236.78, "end": 240.78, "text": " Those who can adapt thrive, while those who can't are pushed out of the workforce.", "tokens": [51175, 5845, 508, 460, 6068, 22191, 11, 981, 883, 508, 460, 470, 389, 7121, 503, 286, 262, 16433, 13, 51375], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1314789845393254, "compression_ratio": 1.575609756097561, "no_speech_prob": 